window.products.push({"id":1036080,"name":"LIVILAN Oversized Pineapple Beach Towel, Lightweight Microfiber Absorbent Quick Dry Sand Free Blanket Towels, Thin and Soft Pool Travel Bath Swim Towe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iv-YEt9YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【SIZE AND MATERIALS-PINEAPPLE BEACH TOWEL】Large size: 30”X60”, weight: 9.1 ounces. Our large-size pineapple beach towel is suitable for most adults and children, and when it is unfolded, it is enough to wrap your whole body. The yellow beach towel is made of high-quality and durable microfiber, which had good liquid absorption and sand resistance that can quickly dry your skin. 【SIMPLE TO MAINTAIN AND SOFT TOUCH-MICROFIBER BEACH TOWEL】This microfiber beach towel can be machine washed or hand washed. It is recommended to wash with mild cod water, and then hang it up and dry naturally. You don’t have to worry that the colorful pineapple pattern will fade. In addition, this children’s towel is made of 100% microfiber, which a smooth surface and soft touch. It is environment friendly and safe enough to touch the skin. 【SAND FREE AND QUICK DRY-BEACH TOWEL FOR ADULTS】：The fabric of lightweight towels is different from cotton, but smoother and thinner than cotton. Our microfiber towels can easily shake off the sand on the surface and wash easily. In addition, it absorbs liquid very fast and absorbs almost 3-5 times that f cotton, so you can quickly dry and resist cold air after bathing or swimming. This travel towel can dry quickly, and you can keep your body dry for a long time. 【EASY TO CARRY AND WIDE APPLICABILITY】This is not a traditional camping towel. Compared with ordinary beach towels, our lightweight beach towels are lighter and thinner. Therefore, packaging and carrying are very convenient. When you travel with this towel, you don’t have to worry about the weight of your bag. You can also roll up this soft beach towel for travel, camping, hiking or gifts. We believe that our lightweight sand-proof beach towels will bring you a wonderful travel experience. 【CONSIDERATE CUSTOMER SERVICE】We have full ownership and responsibility for the quality of our products. If you have any questions about our swimming towels, please feel free to contact us and we will reply to you within 24 hours. We will also listen to customer feedback and adjust every detail to ensure product quality, fit and comfort, and strive to make you 100% satisfied.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iv-YEt9YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LIVILAN","source_asin":"B0989LTH9R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1036080","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0989LTH9R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0989LTH9R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
