window.products.push({"id":1036147,"name":"Insulated Lunch Bag, Dual Compartment Lunch Tote Box Leak-proof Bento Organizer, Double Deck Cooler for Men,Women for Office/School/Picnic/Travel/Camp","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Do01W+kqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HIGH-QUALITY &ENVIRONMENTAL: The lunch bag is made of 600D polyester, durable, anti-tear and waterproof. It adopts 0.7mm EVA inner material, thermal insulated, puncture-proof and easy to clean. PVC-, BPA-, phthalate-, formaldehyde- and lead-free makes this bag an eco-friendly option. ENJOY A BIG LUNCH: Premium EVA and 7mm Foam lining offer great thermal resistance to keep food fresh and warm/cold. That means you'll never waste money on gel packs or ice packs again. Ideal for packing fresh, healthy foods: fruits, vegetables, cheese and more. To make the midday meal just a little bit tastier. MEASUREMENT & MORE FEATURES: It measures 10.24 x 6.3 x 7.09 inches. Besides, The lightweight, padded handle, upgraded durable smooth zipper, easy to clean, waterproof, convenient features will never let you down. Pack healthy meals using this insulated lunch totes that are sure to make you the envy of the office or lunchroom! TRAVEL-FRIENDLY DESIGN: Spacious enough to fit 1-2 person’s lunch. The front pocket allows you to store extra items, even the notebook. And two side mesh pockets are suitable for a milk bottle, snacks and utensils. Better yet, there are three ways to open the bag: front open, back open and side open. BUY WITH 100% CONFIDENCE: This lunch bag can be used as lunch bag, picnic bag, sundry bag, suitable for all groups. We guarantee 2 years protection for free from the date of its original purchase. If you encounter any issue, contact us. We guarantee you will experience a good lunch or your money back!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Do01W+kqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CANWAY","source_asin":"B07GVLQ6VD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1036147","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GVLQ6VD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GVLQ6VD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
