window.products.push({"id":1036149,"name":"6ft Christmas Tinsel Tree with String Lights, Christmas Decorations Indoor, Pop up Christmas Tree with Stand Easy-Assembly, Big Xmas Decor for Bedroom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CFoLC4OeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"To balance the aesthetic, put one Fireplace Christmas Tree on each side of the fireplace mantel. With this kind of artificial tree, every day is Christmas! Specification: Color: Gold, Red, Silver, Green and Multicolor (Choose one) Material: Metal+PVC Tree length: 1.8m(6ft) Power: USB Plug Light Modes: Combination, in Waves, Sequential, Slo-Glo, Chaing/ Flash, Slow Fade, Twinkle/ Flash, Steady on. The button on the plug can control different lighting modes. Package Includes: 1 x Tinsel Christmas tree 1 x LED String Lights 1 x Plastic stand 5 x Plastic Pipes Tips: If you turn on the lights in the dark, the pop up Christmas tree looks prettier. If you use it outdoors(such as outdoor steps, gardens...), please fix the base of the tree with heavy things, so as not to knocked down by wind or pets. If you want it to be more plentiful, you can hang some gadgets such as Christmas socks. Health and Safety Dense branches ensure a full appearance Strong and Durable Rugged iron frame for your long-term use Convenient Installation Partitioned structure for quick installation disassembly and storage If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CFoLC4OeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GOODLYGHTS","source_asin":"B08JG7MQZF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1036149","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JG7MQZF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JG7MQZF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1036150,"name":"Household Essentials KROSNO Handmade Kai Martini Glasses (Set of 4), 8 oz, Clear","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cBM0NIyjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"KROSNO Kai Martini Glasses are strikingly unique handmade cocktail glasses. Their only nod to conventional martini glasses is in their conical bowl shape. The resemblance ends there. These glasses have an ultra-modern stem. It's thick, and chunky--a presence in your hand that makes your drink even more of an experience. Each handmade glass holds 8 ounces and is made from a single blob or grab of glass. This single-piece construction makes the glasses in this set of 4 strong as well as striking. Smoothed, annealed, and polished, these glasses are a modern take on a classic cocktail--and definitely the way to make a statement. Kai Martini Glasses are made by premier Polish glassmaker KROSNO. With elegant design and artisan craftsmanship, KROSNO makes the finest handmade glassware, and has done so since 1924. NOTE: Glass may vary slightly from dimensions listed because each piece is handmade. This is a mark of craftsmanship, evidence of the high-quality and care that go into every single piece of KROSNO glass.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cBM0NIyjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Household Essentials","source_asin":"B016NGICB8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1036150","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B016NGICB8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B016NGICB8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
