window.products.push({"id":1036294,"name":"8 Pack Reusable Straws for Drinks - 6 Glass Straws, 2 Stainless Steel Straws, with 2 Cleaning Brushes - NUIBY Smoothie Drinking Straws","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Rw8yMY2KL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Every time when you use plastic straws, won’t you worry that your heath may be harmed by BPA or some unsafe material? What's more, these disposable straws waste a lot of your money! Here comes a best solution for you - safe, durable, reusable straws - Nuiby Glass & Stainless Steel Straws - Food grade, BPA & lead free. One package includes 8 packs straws with different length & width for different purpose + 2 cleaning brushes: - 6 Pack Glass straws: Length 7.9” (200mm), OD 0.32” (8mm), Fits many kinds of cups & mugs. - 2 Pack Stainless Steel straws: Length 8.5” (215mm), 1 with OD 0.24” (6mm), 1 with OD 0.39\" (10mm). Both Fit 20 OZ Yeti Tumblers and other cups & mugs. 0.39\" OD Wide Stainless Steel straws fits Smoothies, Frozen Drinks, Shakes and More. - 2 free Cleaning Brushes: 7.9” (20mm) length, can easily clean the straws. Features: - Glass straws are made of borosilicate glass, and Stainless Steel straws are made of 18/8 Stainless Steel (break-proof). They are all rust-proof and reusable. - These straws retain the temperature of your cold drink and helps keep it from melting down faster. - They work great with Mason Jars, To Go Cups, iced tea glasses, & Tumblers and many more! - We've created a beautiful addition to any drink, an awesome way to finish off the look of an amazing bar beverage for your guests. Note: * Not recommend to use while moving for the material is hard.  * Hand wash is recommended for glass straws even they are dish washer safe.  * Children is prohibited to use in order to avoid scald or frostbite.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Rw8yMY2KL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NUIBY","source_asin":"B01LX1DQ4X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1036294","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LX1DQ4X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LX1DQ4X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
