window.products.push({"id":1036317,"name":"200PCS 'Clean Mate' Air Fryer Disposable Paper Liner Round 6.3 Inch, Non-Stick Parchment Air Fryer Liners, Natural Food Grade, Oil-Proof, Water-Proof ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tPXNyhFDL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"Heat Resistant and Reliable Material: The Astaresk air fryer parchment liners using food grade parchment. It is waterproof, oil-proof, non-stick, can withstand temperatures up to 428 degrees Fahrenheit, with high heat resistance, no fear of hot air circulation. Additionally, it will not affect the taste of your food, 100% healthy and safe. It can cover food extensively without fouling your fryer! And air fryer disposable paper liner is oil-proof and saves you the pain of cleaning up after meals. No Interfering with Internal Air Circulation: The heat is generated by air circulation from the pan's wall, and it won't affect the air circulation by using disposable paper liners. Our air fryer liners are green, biodegradable and chemical free. When baking, the grease comes out to the paper liner, giving you healthier foods. The paper liners can be applied for baking, roasting, frying, or serving food, suitable for home baking, camping, BBQ, summer party, and so on, lightweight and practical. Unique Design: Non-stick disposable air fryer liners are designed with a round bowl shape, which do not need to tear, fold, cut, nor bend, and you can directly put it in when you are ready to cook. Its heightened edge 1.77 inches can protect the side of fryers and prevent food from sticking to them. And the air fryer parchment paper has a wide range of uses. It is suitable for air fryer, microwave, oven, steamer, cooker, etc. Keep Your Air Fryer Clean: Easy to clean, no greasy mess. These round parchment paper air fryer liners using double sided silicone oil design, can effectively keep the food residue away from your air fryer and make it as clean as unused, saving time and energy. Including 200pcs of paper liners, offer a wide range of choices for your daily cooking, baking and replacement needs. Just throw away the parchment paper liner after use. No need to clean the fryer anymore. Easy Organization Solutions: With home life getting busier by the day, the kitchen cleaning can be an absolute nightmare to maintain. Our Parchment paper liners are a must-have for your food preparation needs! Ideal for professional chefs and home cooks alike, which helps food crisp better or steam without sticking to your air fryer basket or steamer basket while evenly cooking your food. We donate a portion of all sales to help cure hunger in minority communities. Note: Please do not add paper while the frying is in preheat mode. After the frying is preheated, add paper and food. Preheating will produce strong hot air, do not let the paper contact the heating tube, otherwise there will be the so-called paper burning situation. The food should cover at least 2/3 of the area of the parchment paper to prevent the paper from being burned by the heating element.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tPXNyhFDL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Astaresk","source_asin":"B0BB5RGF7C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1036317","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BB5RGF7C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BB5RGF7C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
