window.products.push({"id":1036323,"name":"CoTa Global Moonlight Sailboat Decor – Handmade Wooden Boat Decor, Cute Beach Style Model Sail Boat Decorations, Nautical Themed Table Top Decor Livin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71APwDqJpfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE MOONLIGHT WOODEN BOAT MODEL COMES WITH A UNIQUE DESIGN YOU LOVE – Bring the experience of cruising the wide-open sea by the charming sailing boat. Displaying beach theme room decor such as the Moonlight home decor boat to a mantle, shelves, bathroom, or bedroom bring on the feel of the deep blue ocean to your home. A bright beach themed home decor for a classic nautical-themed home or as charming lighthouse outdoor decor. THE MOONLIGHT BOAT DECORATION IS FOR THOSE WHO LOVE SEA ADVENTURE – If you dream about sailing and love sail boats, display the Moonlight sailboat decoration as one of your beach themed decor for home. These model boats complement the blue and white palette of your nautical-themed home. Moonlight sailboat is a perfect gift for those who love ocean travel. A nautical boat perfect for replicating the charm of staying in a beach house or seaside. INCLUDED WITH THE BLUE NAUTICAL DECOR SAILBOAT ORNAMENT – Includes 1 Moonlight Sailing Model Boat with stand. The wooden sailing boat has a fishnet tied to the mast adorned with shells while the other has a classic nautical blue and white stripe. Sailing boat decoration fits any sea themed table top or desk. Moonlight nautical decor boat measures 7Lx1.4Wx12.5H inches. HIGH QUALITY MOONLIGHT BOAT MODEL DECOR – Made of premium quality wood, the nautical boat ornament is both durable and lightweight. The sailboat statue is not a model kit and is already beautifully assembled. Painted by hand in blue and white, the wooden sailboat decoration would charm guests with its realistic details. Place as a charming bathroom boat decor, living room boat centerpiece, or fun beach party decorations. IDEAL USE FOR THE MOONLIGHT WOODEN BOAT DECORATION – The Moonlight Boat Display is the perfect present for nautical display lovers. CoTa Global’s sailboat gifts are designed and made by hand with charming nautical details, cool colors and when added to a room feel like a ship’s cabin. Sail boat decoration comes with a flat steady stand for display; to be placed on a shelf, office desk, or mantle along with other nautical knick knacks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71APwDqJpfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CoTa Global","source_asin":"B084JD65GT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1036323","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084JD65GT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084JD65GT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
