window.products.push({"id":1036419,"name":"Portable Air Conditioner Fan 4 in1— Desktop Cooling Fan with 4 Wind Speed & 2 Spray Modes, 7 Colors LED Light & 2-8H Timer, 700ml Large Watertank High","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bVh90J94L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄【Ultrasonic Atomizers & High Efficiency of Cooling】: Our conditioners Adopt double ultrasonic atomizers and wet curtain triple cooling, The use of dual ultrasonic atomizers and wet curtain triple cooling can quickly cool your space and blow cool cold air for you. If you add ice cubes, it will achieve a more cooling effect. and It comes with a grip that can be carried to different places. Power banks, laptops, and USB charging heads can all provide power to it. ❄【2 Spray Modes and 4 Wind Speeds】：The air conditioner fan has two modes of natural wind and cold wind. There are 4 wind speeds can be adjusted. The maximum wind speed of the fan reaches 2.8m/s. The wind direction can be adjusted up and down. Adding ice to the water will give you a different cool experience! The air conditioner uses atomized cooling with a 4.5μm atomizer, so you won't get wet even if you blow for a long time, and you won't get the countertop wet. ❄【Auto Power Off & 7 Color Lights】：The air conditioner fan will automatically shut down after 8 hours of continuous operation so that you are not afraid of catching a cold or headaches even when you are in a deep sleep. There are 7 kinds of automatically changing lights that you can choose to turn off or on. When turned on, the warm atmosphere will help you fall asleep better and enjoy the comfort of deep sleep. ❄【480ml Large Water Tank for a Lasting Cooler Experience】：The air conditioner fan has a large capacity condensate water tank of 480ml. It can collect condensed water generated in the cold wind process so you can enjoy a constant stream of cold air. There is a drain hole at the bottom of the water tank. You can discharge the water manually once the water level is too high. ❄【Noiseless & Protection Function】：The noise of the air conditioner fan is only 40-50 dB, even late night will not disturb your deep sleep. and it allows you or your child to enjoy reading or deep sleep or nap without headaches and colds caused by prolonged cold winds. In addition, the water shortage protection function turns the water into the natural wind when it runs out, enjoy the comfort of deep sleep.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bVh90J94L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Boutitween","source_asin":"B0B1HXWJ8W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1036419","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1HXWJ8W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1HXWJ8W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
