window.products.push({"id":1036541,"name":"1000 Thread Count 100% Pure Egyptian Cotton – Sateen Weave Premium Bed Sheets, 4- Piece Light Blue Full- Size Luxury Sheet Set, Fits mattresses Upto 1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JTbTb0XuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Highlights: 100% Long Staple Egyptian Pure Cotton – Sateen Weave Queen, King, California King sizes. Silky soft and lustrous. Top quality and long lasting. Organic and natural. Pocket friendly. Satisfaction assurance. What makes our linen luxurious? Our sheets are made from a single pure Egyptian cotton yarn. Egyptian cotton is known for its quality and durability. The dyes that we use are organic and safe and adds to the lustrous look that the sheets get because of the sateen weave. The feel and the quality of our premium linen defines luxury. Our bedding has good aesthetics, to elevate your home décor. We double check the quality before delivering it you, so everything is of top-notch. And we sell our bedset at affordable rates. Who are our customers? If you want to experience hotel-like luxury at affordable prices then our bedsheets are for you. Our linens will suit your bedroom décor and all seasons. They are good for summer and night sweats as well. What is in the bag? The 4-piece sheet set contains an oversized flat bedsheet, a fitted sheet with deep pocket and good quality elastic to fit mattresses upto 18”, and a pair of softest pillowcases. These sheets are available in all sizes – Queen, King, California King There are many options for colors. Our linen is soft, comfortable and lustrous. Manufactured: The Weave Story Wash & Maintenance: Machine wash, Only warm temperatures, iron at lower heat.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JTbTb0XuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Comfort Sheets","source_asin":"B08FTGCM9T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1036541","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FTGCM9T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FTGCM9T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
