window.products.push({"id":1036618,"name":"Cosmoved Meat Tenderizer, 56 Stainless Steel Blades, Cooking Tool for Steak, Beef, Chicken, Fish and Pork & Cleaning Brush","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Pb3-sZS9L._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"It is a great tool for quick steak and barbecue. Have you ever wondered why the meat on your barbecue is never as tender and juicy as that of your friends? I wonder why their meat doesn't look broken and shabby like yours? Get ready to be the envy of your less prepared friends! Don't be surprised if guests ask how you cooked such tender meat in minutes! Advantages: Premium Quality Material. The tenderizer reduces the cooking time by 40%. It is BPA-Free, Food grade material that ensures zero health concerns. It will never corrode or rust. Safely Lock & protective cap will protect your hands. Cleaning Brush; makes cleaning easy and fast. Easy to clean and safe: this tenderizer is dishwasher safe, easy to store & portable with a built-in safety lock & protective cap. How it works? Meat loosened with this tenderizer retains its taste better, remaining soft and juicy during frying. When processing with a tenderizer, the fibers of the product are less injured than when processing with a hammer, and the connective tissues, on the contrary, are destroyed as much as possible. In addition, heat waves pass through the tissues of the loosened food more easily, and the meat is roasted much faster and more evenly. When processing with a tenderizer, the fibers of the product are less injured than when processing with a hoe or a hammer for meat, and the connective tissues are destroyed as much as possible. Heat waves pass much more easily through the tissues of the loosened product, therefore any boneless meat after processing is fried much faster and more evenly. The principle of working with a tenderizer is quite simple: using parallel blades-needles, notches are applied to the surface of a piece of meat. The incisions destroy the connective tissue and increase the product area.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Pb3-sZS9L._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"N\\","source_asin":"B08MCM3Q2T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1036618","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MCM3Q2T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MCM3Q2T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
