window.products.push({"id":1036674,"name":"16 Pcs Desk Drawer Organizers Trays Set 5-Size Clear Drawer Organizer Container Makeup Drawer Organizer Plastic Bathroom Storage Bins Versatile Drawer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zhVn4DmeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【16-PICESE SET 5 DIFFERENT SIZE OF ORGANIZER 】 Divided organizers set can keep different sizes items organized. Also you can customize the layout to fit any size drawer or specific need. 1-Extra large rectangle (9\"L x 6\"W x 2\"H), 2-Large rectangle (6\"L x 6\"W x 2\"H, 2-Medium long rectangle（9\"L x 3\"W x 2\"H), 5-Small rectangle (6\"L x 3\"W x 2\"H), 6-Mini square (3\"L x 3\"W x 2\"H). Great for storage of various size items. 【Multifunctional use】 5 kinds of ideal organizer organization system, suitable for different size drawers. You can store and sort sundries items like makeup tools, dressing table accessories, kitchen tools, and office supplies. Put your items in a separate box to keep the table tidy. You could also stack it one by one when not use. 【Durable and sturdy material】Our drawer organizer is made of sturdy transparent plastic material, and the silicone anti-skid pad on the bottom of the container prevents the box from moving freely when dragging the drawer, so it can provide you with a longer service life. It is very environmentally friendly, not fragile, and recyclable. 【Easy care & save time】 Clear desk drawer organizers can save time to organize and find your belongings, keep your desk or drawer clean and tidy, and help you achieve a neat and efficient lifestyle. Only requires a damp, warm soap sponge or cloth for quick and easy cleaning. This is the best storage option for your drawer 【PERFECT FOR STORAGE】 It is versatile drawer organizer, fit nicely into different drawers, such as dresser / bathroom / kitchen / office drawers. Great for organizing cosmetic, make up tools, hair accessories, nail polish, jewelry, hairbrushes, medicine, tableware and office supplies. A great storage option for your drawers, makes everything look neat and organized.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zhVn4DmeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JIIKOOAI","source_asin":"B08Y6VF25J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1036674","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Y6VF25J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Y6VF25J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
