window.products.push({"id":1036677,"name":"ZUNMOS Gaming Chair PU Leather Office Chair Flip-up Soft Armrest Desk Chair Height Adjustable Computer Chair with Lumbar Support Swivel Chair, Black a","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":86.39,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rnuyULzfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Flip-up Armrest and Soft Padded: The specially designed chair armrests can be flipped up or down according to your needs. The down position of the armrests will provide additional support for your arms during working or gaming. In addition, the armrests have added soft armrest pads with a thickness of 3.5 cm. If you need to save some space while relaxing for a moment, just flip up. We recommend that you flip up the armrest if you use this desk chair for studying or drawing. Adjustable Height and Rocking : Our ergonomic chairs are equipped with a gas lift mechanism. You can smoothly adjust its height by rising a lever located under the seat. The resistance of the seat back can be adjusted by turning the knob under the seat. Then gently pull the lever outward to easily adjust from work to rocking mode. The entire backrest is elastic to ideally conform to your spine and reduce back fatigue. Breathable PU leather: This product is available in black mixed with grey, blue, red or white. Excellent PU leather material has the characteristics of breathable waterproof, wear-resistant, easy to clean and so on. Also, we make sure that no animals are harmed during the manufacturing process of the product, it can not only be your new gaming chair/office chair, but also as a gift for your family or friends on Thanksgiving, Christmas or New Years. Sturdy and Durable: Our modern gaming chairs with sort armrests provide durable metal legs, safety gas lifts, and nylon casters that can support up to 250 pounds. The 360-degree rotating multi-directional wheels ensure smooth rolling for longer, providing freedom of movement and the convenience of communicating with others. Make sure you can juggle the work of multiple workstations at all times. Easy install: The tall adjustable office chair comes with all hardware and necessary tools. Most people can follow the assembly video we've uploaded and have it up and running in about 15-20 minutes. If there are missing any parts or have any questions about the installation process, please feel free to let us know. Item shape: L-Shaped","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rnuyULzfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZUNMOS","source_asin":"B0BGSD3BNV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1036677","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGSD3BNV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGSD3BNV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
