window.products.push({"id":1036726,"name":"YTC Square FLW Autumn Sumac in Colorful Square Arrow and Stripe Designs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":78.1,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YOM4qyOnL._AC_.jpg","description":"This elegant little Frank Lloyd Wright Autumn Sumac Stained Glass Panel is adapted from a window in the Susan Lawrence Dana House in Springfield, Illinois, featured Mr. Wright's repeated design of the native prairie Sumac plant, in an abstract form. The rich amber and green colors in the glass give the piece an autumnal feeling. The original window was one of a pair located in the reception hall of the house. This stained glass panel has been developed in association with the Frank Lloyd Wright Foundation. On this glass panel, enamel colors are individually applied to a single sheet of glass which is then kiln fired to permanently fuse the enamels to the glass. The glass panel is then framed with a metal came and includes hanging chain and wood stand for desk or table display. Ht: 10\". W: 6.25\".","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YOM4qyOnL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YTC","source_asin":"B00F0SL7V8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1036726","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00F0SL7V8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00F0SL7V8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
