window.products.push({"id":1036757,"name":"Classic Sleep Products Better Sleep 100 Free Flow Hardside Waterbed Mattress California Queen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41uhIT9P5OL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Freeflow Waterbed Mattress by Classic Sleep Products is a great, cost effective hard side waterbed. This Hardside waterbed is as wavy and free-flowing as it gets, with this full motion waterbed mattress, you will feel like you are sleeping right on the water. Freeflow waterbeds are great for reducing pressure on the body, and allowing the muscles to completely relax. For added durability and support, the corners are reinforced with extra material. The Freeflow waterbed is made using the most durable vinyl on the market today. Additionally, the sturdy inT Shell in corner seam construction gives the waterbed even more support. For these reasons, Classic Sleep Products offers a 6 year limited warranty with this product. Classic Sleep Freeflow Waterbed Mattress Features:100% free flow for a full motion feelConstructed with the most durable vinyl in the waterbed industryReinforced cornersSturdy \"T Shell in corner seam construction for added support6 year limited warrantyPlease Note: For California Queen and California King sizes, \"Queen\" and \"King\" will be listed on shipping box - be aware that these products are in fact California sizes Standard Mattress Sizes:Super Single: 8.5\" H x 48\" W x 83.5\" DCalifornia Queen: 8.5\" H x 59.5\" W x 83.5\" DCalifornia King: 9.5\" H x 71.5\" W x 83.5\" D Hardside Waterbed Mattress InformationHardside waterbeds consist of a bladder and a frame. Frames are usually made of wood and the bladder sits right inside the frame on a plywood platform, this platform is reinforced underneath. Usually frames have side panels that sit on top of it to make it easier for an individual to climb in and out of bed. The bladder, usually made form vinyl is the chamber that holds the water. Bladders can range from free-flowing to semi-waveless to waveless. A free-flowing bladder will give the effect of a wavy bed, with full motion","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41uhIT9P5OL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Classic Sleep Products","source_asin":"B004WP1TMC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1036757","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004WP1TMC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004WP1TMC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
