window.products.push({"id":1036929,"name":"Madison Park Laurel 3 Piece Duvet Cover Faux Silk Shabby Chic Diamond Tufted Pinch Pleat Design Reverse Solid Shabby Chic All Season Comforter Cover B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81i1j1+d8sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Elegance meets shabby chic with the Madison Park Laurel 3 Piece Duvet Cover Set. The solid ivory duvet cover flaunts a tufted pinch pleat design with a pieced border flange that creates an elegant look. Matching shams perfectly coordinate with the top of the duvet cover to complete the shabby chic bedding set. Made from faux silk fabric that offers a beautiful luster and easy care after steam press, this duvet cover set transforms your bedroom décor into a graceful and luxurious space. Machine washable on delicate cycle only. Button closures help secure a comforter insert within the duvet cover and four inside ties in the corners help prevent it from shifting (insert is NOT included).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81i1j1+d8sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Madison Park","source_asin":"B07KWXX9M3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1036929","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KWXX9M3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KWXX9M3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
